  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Solidarity Brigades is an exchange project involving organisations in Guatemala, Brazil,
Colombia and Norway all seeking to develop young leaders by strengthening their technical,
organisational and political capacity on a local, national and international level. All this to
improve their work for democracy, global justice, sustainable agroecological production,
autonomy, women and indigenous rights. Strengthening the unity and solidarity in the struggle
for global justice is one of the exchange&#xB4;s expected results.</narrative>
  </description>
